  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a la Implementacin del Programa Reformas de Recursos Hdricos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Implementation of the Program for the Reforms of Water Resources</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El propsito de esta facilidad es apoyar la implementacin de las reformas acordadas entre el GdP y el Banco en el Programa de Polticas de RH (PE-L1024).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The facility will support the modernization of the systems to manage the Water Resources in Peru. For this, it will concentrate in four components: i) Training for the New National Water Authority; ii) National Information System for Water Resources; iii) Decentralization of Management of Water Resources and iv) Coordination and Evaluation</narrative>
  </description>
